 "strings": {
  "Yeah, maybe you're right.": "",
  "Yeah, maybe.": "",
  "Ayabe's sure taking his time\ngetting here.": "",
  "Should we ask that guy?": "",
  "Should we talk to the clerk?": "",
  "I wouldn't.\nWho knows if he's one of Ayabe's boys.": "",
  "I wouldn't.\nWho knows if he's one of Ayabe's.": "",
  "True, but...": "",
  "Yeah, but...": "",
  "Look, Ayabe's a dirty cop.\nThe last thing he wants is his cover blown.": "",
  "We won't get a peep from him\nif that happens, got it?": "",
  "We won't get a peep from him\nif that happens. Got it?": "",
  "Sure, sure.": "",
  "For now, we wait.": "",
  "Hm? Hey, someone's coming.": "",
  "Hm?\nHey, someone's coming.": "",
  "Welcome.\nPick a rod, I guess.": "",
  "Yo, gotten any bites today?": "",
  "Yo.\nBeen gettin' any bites?": "",
  "Not even a nibble.": "",
  "And you're scarin' em off.\nGet lost.": "",
  "And you're not helpin'.\nGet the hell out.": "",
  "C'mon, don't be like that.\nYou're here for Ayabe, right?": "",
  "C'mon, don't be like that.\nYou two are here for Ayabe, right?": "",
  "Tch, who's that?": "",
  "Sorry, who?": "",
  "Don't play dumb with me.\nIt's not gonna end well for you.": "",
  "Don't play dumb with me.\nIt won't end well for you.": "",
  "You've got it all wrong.\nWe're just fishin'.": "",
  "You've got the wrong guys.\nWe're just here to fish.": "",
  "Right. We ain't your boys.": "",
  "Damn right.\nWe ain't your marks.": "",
  "We look like the type\nto hang out with cops?": "",
  "Do we really look like we\nhang around cops?": "",
  "Who said anything about\nhim being a cop?": "",
  "I didn't say a word about Ayabe\nbeing a cop, buddy.": "",
  "Oh well... Aw fuck.": "",
  "Huh? Uh... Well, I just... you know—": "",
  "So you do know him!\nI fuckin' called it!": "",
  "So you <font_kind=yakuza_italic>do</font_kind> know him!\nI fuckin' called it!": "",
  "These assholes baited me!": "",
  "Dammit, the bastards tricked me!": "",
  "That one was all you...": "",
  "So, whaddya want with Ayabe?": "",
  "Tell me, or else.": "",
  "Yeah, I'm real scared.": "",
  "I'm shakin' in my boots here.": "",
  "Look, we don't want trouble.\nJust step off and we won't hurt you.": "",
  "You got balls, don't ya?\nI'm gonna serve 'em to ya!": "",
  "You got guts, I'll give you that.\nWe're gonna fuck you up!": "",
  "You all done?\nOr do ya want some more!?": "",
  "You want some more?\nJust say the word!": "",
  "Doesn't sound like they do.": "",
  "Doesn't sound like it.": "",
  "All right, you boys are in.": "",
  "All right.\nYou guys pass.": "",
  "We what?": "",
  "Ayabe-san's careful dealing\nwith new people.": "",
  "Ayabe-san's careful dealing with\nnew people.": "",
  "He's selling police info, after all. Gotta make\nsure his partners can keep a secret.": "",
  "He's selling police info, after all.\nGotta make sure his partners can keep a secret.": "",
  "And these guys?": "",
  "Working for Ayabe-san.": "",
  "Ayabe knows me though, doesn't he?": "",
  "I figured Ayabe already knew\nI could handle myself.": "",
  "You're Kaito-san, yeah?\nThe boss told me about you.": "",
  "You're Kaito-san, yeah?\nAyabe-san's already told me about you.": "",
  "You're dumber than I thought.": "",
  "You're even dumber than\nhe said you'd be.": "",
  "Dumb!?\nLook here, asshole...": "",
  "Not now, Kaito.\nAs for you... where's Ayabe?": "",
  "Okay, okay, relax. So...\nWhere do we find Ayabe?": "",
  "Behind the counter.\nCome take a look.": "",
  "What the...?": "",
  "What is that...?": "",
  "You're looking at the entrance to L'Amant,\nthe best-kept casino in all of Kamurocho.": "",
  "You're looking at the entrance to one of\nKamurocho's finest casinos... L'Amant.": "",
  "L'Amant?": "",
  "French for \"lover.\"": "",
  "You know what they say. There's an amazing\nlover behind every coy bride.": "",
  "\"There's an amazing lover behind\nevery coy wife's back,\" right?": "",
  "Heh, well aren't you guys international.": "",
  "Gotta be classy if it's French.": "",
  "Go down and have fun.\nAyabe-san will be here soon.": "",
  "You can go have fun while\nAyabe-san's on his way.": "",
  "Here, these are on the house.": "",
  "So the stupid pond was just a front?": "",
  "So that pond was seriously\njust a front?": "",
  "Wowww.": "",
  "Fine by me!": "",
  "Heh, fine by me.": "",
  "Well, wanna see what they've got to offer?\nMay as well put those chips to use.": "",
  "C'mon, let's see what this joint's got to offer.\nMight as well use those free chips.": "",
  "Playtime's over, Tak.\nC'mon, Ayabe's waiting.": "",
  "Hey, Tak. Playtime's just about over.\nC'mon, Ayabe's waiting.": "",
  "Good to see you, Kaito-san.": "",
  "Good seeing you, Kaito-san.\nAnd...": "",
  "I take it you're Yagami-san?": "",
  "Or would Yagami-sensei be more appropriate?": "",
  "Or maybe Yagami-sensei\nwould be more appropriate?": "",
  "Whatever works for you.": "",
  "Sorry about that whole test thing.": "",
  "Sorry 'bout that test earlier.": "",
  "Name's Ayabe,\nKamurocho Organized Crime Division.": "",
  "The name's Ayabe. Kamurocho police,\nOrganized Crime Division.": "",
  "Pleasure.": "",
  "So, how are you liking the casino?\nPretty swanky, huh?": "",
  "Why, you the owner or something?": "",
  "Why do you ask?\nDon't tell me you're the owner.": "",
  "Not quite.\nI do my part to keep it hidden, though.": "",
  "Nah, I just do my part\nto keep the place hidden.": "",
  "Cut a deal with the Tojo, too.\nBarely pay a lick of protection money now.": "",
  "I cut a deal with the Tojo Clan,\nand now they barely pay a lick of protection money.": "",
  "I guess I do practically run the place.": "",
  "...You know, I guess I do\npractically run the place.": "",
  "And you never invited me?\nI'm hurt.": "",
  "And somehow, you never found the time\nto invite me.": "",
  "Sorry, I can't give you the VIP treatment\nwhen all you buy is the dirt off my shoes.": "",
  "You want VIP treatment when all you buy is my cheap dirt?\nSorry, but that's not how it works.": "",
  "All right let's cut to the chase,\nshall we?": "",
  "Fine. Then why <font_kind=yakuza_italic>did</font_kind> you call us here?": "",
  "You know those Kyorei murder cases?\nThey're all managed by my boss. Guy named Kuroiwa.": "",
  "About those Kyorei murder cases, with the eye shit...\nThe cop heading them is Kuroiwa, my boss.": "",
  "He's the one who brought your captain in.": "",
  "He's the one who brought Hamura in.": "",
  "But thanks to you, Hamura walked,\nand now Kuroiwa's got egg on his face.": "",
  "But... thanks to you, Hamura walked.\nAnd Kuroiwa got egg on his face.": "",
  "Felt good, lemme tell you.\nI'm a fan of your work.": "",
  "Now <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that</font_kind> felt good.\nLemme tell you, I'm a fan of your work.": "",
  "So here, the first one's on the house.": "",
  "So here you go.\nFirst hit's free.": "",
  "Guess we got Kuroiwa to thank for this.": "",
  "Guess we got Kuroiwa\nto thank for this.": "",
  "Now, I pulled together reports\non all the cases so far.": "",
  "Now, I pulled together the reports\non all your Mole's cases so far.": "",
  "Three in total, including\nthe trial the other day.": "",
  "Three in total,\nincluding the trial the other day.": "",
  "Not so fast.\nYou're on the hook if this shit gets out.": "",
  "Let's get one thing clear.\nYou're on the hook if this shit gets out.": "",
  "Pretty scary.\nAnd what happens if it does?": "",
  "Scary.\nAnd what's the price if it does?": "",
  "You're dead.": "",
  "Death.": "",
  "Figured as much.": "",
  "Protect that with your life, huh?": "",
  "In other words,\nprotect that envelope with your life.": "",
  "Roger.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(That's Kamurocho for you.\nShady as all hell, but you can get anything you want.)</color>": "",
  "Can you tell me more\nabout this Kuroiwa guy?": "",
  "He's the darling of\nthe Kamuro police station.": "",
  "He's the \"hero\"\nof the Kamuro police station.": "",
  "Strong, popular, and always gets his mark.\nThey've got him fast-tracked for promotion.": "",
  "And you don't like him... why?": "",
  "So... why don't you like him?": "",
  "Guy's too damn perfect!": "",
  "Guy's too perfect.": "",
  "Think it's any fun working\nwith a perfectionist?": "",
  "Come on. You really think you'd like working\nwith a fella like that?": "",
  "Not to mention he's a handsome devil.": "",
  "Envy's what makes a man ugly, friend.\nEspecially odd coming from a dirty cop.": "",
  "Man, envy's an ugly thing.\nEspecially comin' from a dirty cop.": "",
  "I dunno, I think it's kinda refreshing.": "",
  "Glad you see it my way, Yagami-san.\nHere, look at this asshole.": "",
  "I knew you'd understand, Yagami-san.\nHere, this is Kuroiwa.": "",
  "Yeah, handsome.": "",
  "Not a face I'll forget.": "",
  "Right. He knows who you are,\nby the way.": "",
  "Good. He already knows yours.": "",
  "After all, you're the guy\nwho got Hamura acquitted.": "",
  "Anyway.\nDon't open that here, okay?": "",
  "Anyway, don't open that here, okay?": "",
  "I'll keep it shut tight\nuntil I'm back in my office.": "",
  "I'll keep it shut tight until I'm back in my office.\nToo many prying eyes everywhere else.": "",
  "That work?": "",
  "I'm usually hanging 'round Tender.\nSwing by there if you need anything else.": "",
  "I'm usually hanging 'round Tender.\nSwing by there if you ever need anything else.": "",
  "Glad that's over with.\nI'm gonna play a few hands while I'm here.": "",
  "Glad that's over with.\nI'm gonna stick around for a few hands.": "",
  "You staying, or...?": "",
  "You staying too?": "",
  "I'll think about it.": "",
  "Righto. See ya around.": "",
  "Righto.\nI'll see ya around.": "",
  "What was that about?": "",
  "What was that about...?": "",
  "Were they going after this...?": "",
  "Did they want this?": "",
  "Glad one of us is earning his pay.\nHow're those docs from Ayabe looking?": "",
  "Still at it, Tak?\nHow're Ayabe's documents comin' along?": "",
  "Not bad.\nHow'd things go at the casino?": "",
  "Not bad.\nAnd you? Any big winnings to report?": "",
  "I won a mil or so.": "",
  "Just a million yen.": "",
  "A mil!?": "",
  "I'd've kept going,\nbut that seemed like a good round number.": "",
  "Oh good, guess I don't\nneed to pay you this month.": "",
  "So, Kaito-san...\nI guess you don't need a check this month?": "",
  "Hey, I ain't a charity.": "",
  "C'mon, that's not the same thing.": "",
  "Anyway.\nAnything good in there?": "",
  "Anyway.\nYou find anything on the Mole in there?": "",
  "Not yet. The cops only got\nas far as arresting Hamura.": "",
  "Not yet. After all, they had to resort to\narresting our \"innocent\" captain.": "",
  "According to this, that was the only lead\nthey had. They're as stumped as we are.": "",
  "According to the case history...\nAside from him, they didn't have any other leads.": "",
  "Huh. No wonder Ayabe was practically\ngiving that shit away.": "",
  "Guess that kinda makes sense...\nNo wonder Ayabe practically gave that shit away.": "",
  "There is something in here\nabout the second murder, though.": "",
  "Except... there is something\non the Mole's second victim.": "",
  "Apparently they had been tracking the victim,\nKunimura, right up until his death.": "",
  "Seems like the police had been tracking this guy\nKunimura, right up until his death.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(He's the Mole's second victim.\nEyes gouged out, just like Kume's.)</color>": "",
  "I take it that's Kunimura?": "",
  "And this is Kunimura?": "",
  "Yup. Two hours before his death, he was seen\nleaving a brothel called Konban Wife.": "",
  "Yup. Two hours before his death,\nhe was seen leaving a brothel called Konban Wife.": "",
  "Kinda place where the girls pretend they're married.\nSounds like he was there for a Kanae-chan.": "",
  "Their girls roleplay as their clients' wives.\nSounds like he was there for a Kanae-chan.": "",
  "At least the guy had some fun before he went out.\nHell, that's how I wanna go.": "",
  "I'm gonna go talk to this Kanae-chan.": "",
  "See if she knows anything\nabout Kunimura.": "",
  "With any luck,\nI might even get a lead on the Mole.": "",
  "C'mon man,\nleave the sexy shit to me!": "",
  "C'mon, man,\nleave the sex shops to me!": "",
  "You're too young to handle\na married woman anyway.": "",
  "You do realize I'm just gonna\ntalk to her, right?": "",
  "What \"handling\" do you expect to do?\nI only need to talk to her.": "",
  "You're seriously not letting\nme take point on this one?": "",
  "You seriously making me sit out\non Konban Wife?": "",
  "...What if I tell Mafuyu-chan?": "",
  "What if I tell Mafuyu-chan?": "",
  "Go ahead. No skin off my back.": "",
  "Go ahead.\nNo skin off my back.": "",
  "(Konban Wife...)": "",
  "(The last place Kunimura\nwas seen alive.)": "",
  "Welcome, sir.\nAny requests tonight?": "",
  "Welcome, sir.\nWould you like to request a girl?": "",
  "Huh? I, uh...": "",
  "Yuna-chan, Marin-chan,\nand Kanae-chan are all free tonight.": "",
  "Available right now are...\nYuna-chan, Marin-chan, and Kanae-chan.": "",
  "Here's their pictures.\nIt's 1,000 extra to make specific requests.": "",
  "Here are their pictures.\nIt'll cost 1,000 extra to request a specific girl.": "",
  "So I don't have to pick any of them?\nI see.": "",
  "So I don't have to pick\nany of them?": "",
  "Is this your first time here, sir?\nWhy don't we start by picking a duration?": "",
  "Is this your first time here, sir?\nWell, why don't we start by picking a duration?": "",
  "Duration...?": "",
